title: Global shell › Demo menu › Suggested path
route: Every page (Demo menu › Suggested path)
intro: Seven numbered shortcuts for a guided walk through the demo. Each one closes the menu and opens a page. The numbers are only labels: the steps can be used in any order and as often as wanted. None of them changes any data or the clock.
dir: LR
---
start s1 "Open the Demo menu"
overlay o1 "'SUGGESTED PATH'\nSeven buttons, each with a number in a circle"
process p0 "Every step does the same two things:\nthe menu closes, then the app goes to the address"

click c1 "Click '1  Dashboard: where every request stands'"
process r1 "Go to /dashboard"
goto g1 "Continues in: Dashboard"

click c2 "Click '2  Authorizations: the queue'"
process r2 "Go to /authorizations"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Queue"

click c3 "Click '3  New case: start from a referral'"
process r3 "Go to /authorizations/new\nA blank draft is started and the address becomes /authorizations/new/draft-..."
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › New case › Intake › Start with a referral or patient"

click c4 "Click '4  Eligibility & Benefits: verify a patient'"
process r4 "Go to /authorizations/eligibility/verify"
goto g4 "Continues in: Eligibility & Benefits › Verify a patient"

click c5 "Click '5  Denial Intelligence: D-3318'"
process r5 "Go to /denials?id=D-3318"
goto g5 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence › Open a denial"

click c6 "Click '6  Payers: Cardinal, Changes'"
process r6 "Go to /payers/cardinal?tab=changes"
goto g6 "Continues in: Payers › History & Changes › Read what changed"
click c7 "Click '7  Case Manager: reviews this week'"
process r7 "Go to /manager?tab=reviews"
goto g7 "Continues in: Case Manager › Reviews this week › The list"

s1 --> o1 --> p0
p0 --> c1 & c2 & c3 & c4 & c5 & c6 & c7
c1 --> r1 --> g1
c2 --> r2 --> g2
c3 --> r3 --> g3
c4 --> r4 --> g4
c5 --> r5 --> g5
c6 --> r6 --> g6
c7 --> r7 --> g7
